            "review_title": "Review at Vibe Hip Hop & Afro Beats Cafe",
            "review_text": "Discover39354843393\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat Drinks, Great Staff, Great Atmosphere\nJul 2025 • Friends\nHonestly, the vibe was on point as soon as I walked in. The DJ was killing it with a mix of hip hop, Afrobeats, reggae, and pop. Made the whole place feel alive. The staff were super chill and helpful too, which made the experience even better. I had a couple drinks and they were actually really good — definitely not watered down or basic. If you’re into good music and a laid-back but lively atmosphere, this spot’s worth checking out.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 17, 2025\nVibe Hip Hop & Afro Beats Cafe\nWe so appreciate you for coming & See you soon\nWritten July 20, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
