            "review_text": "Yep C\n1 contribution\n0\nCame for One Drink… Stayed ‘Til 3AM iykyk\nJun 2025 • Friends\nVibe Hip hop isn’t a bar. It’s a sanctuary.\n\nRight on Bui Vien, but feels like you're in Chicago.\n\nNo cheap noise. Just high-quality beats, chill atmosphere, and DJs who *understand dope music*.\n\nHip Hop. Afro Beats. Real Music.\n\nBest nights? Every night it’s open.\n\nCrowd? Global. Dialed-in.\n\nDrinks? Sharp. Service? Friendly & Intelligent.\n\nStay all night. Come back twice.\n\nReady for something calibrated… something cool, this is the spot.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 15, 2025\nVibe Hip Hop & Afro Beats Cafe\nWe so appreciate you for coming & See you soon\nWritten July 20, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
